<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Michigan State Housing 1145 EDT.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Michigan State Housing 1145 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>MICHIGAN STATE HOUSING DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $84,530,000</p>
<p>Single-Family Mortgage Revenue Bonds</p>
<p>1996 Series D (Non-AMT)</p>
<p>1996 Series E (AMT)</p>
<p>Initial trade date and cusips will follow:</p>
<p>Effective at 11:45 A.M. E.D.T., Thursday, October 17, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Comerica Securities - Detroit</p>
<p>McDonald &amp; Company Securities, Inc.</p>
<p>Roney &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
